      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "KITZBUHEL DELIGHT (2) has had three runs this prep without filling a placing. Was again unable to find the frame last start when he finished eighth over 2240m at this track, beaten 15 metres. Likely to get all the favours from this nice draw. Meets a comparable field and he can take care of this line-up. SKIPPYS DELIGHT NZ (1) failed to flatter last time out when eighth, beaten 13 metres, over 2180m at Stawell. Sure to enjoy an economical run from this draw. Tackles a similar assignment and he can turn in a much better performance. MIDNIGHT MOJO (3) is in the mix following a respectable second at her most recent appearance over 1720m at this track. ROSBERG NZ (4) must be considered after he finished runner-up when resuming over 1720m at this track a week ago.",
